error BYN1017: parentheses around a condition are an input form

  3 │     if (x) if (x) print("a");
    │        ^^^ not needed
    │
  help: remove the parentheses
    │ 3 │     if x if (x) print("a");
    │   │        +

error BYN1018: the body of `if` must be a block

  3 │     if (x) if (x) print("a");
    │            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a single statement
    │
  help: wrap the statement in `{ }`

error BYN1017: parentheses around a condition are an input form

  3 │     if (x) if (x) print("a");
    │               ^^^ not needed
    │
  help: remove the parentheses
    │ 3 │     if (x) if x print("a");
    │   │               +

error BYN1018: the body of `if` must be a block

  3 │     if (x) if (x) print("a");
    │                   ^^^^^^^^^^ a single statement
    │
  help: wrap the statement in `{ }`
    │ 3 │     if (x) if (x) { print("a"); }
    │   │                   +++++++++++++++
